From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] FreeChat: delete the media clients report for
 disappearing messages

Element X encrypts attachments in matrix-rust-sdk and cannot list their MXCs in
the event's plaintext. A new endpoint, rooms/{roomId}/event_media, lets the
sender report them once the message is sent. Only for messages with expiry
markers and only media the sender uploaded. The media is deleted when the
message expires; an hourly sweep covers messages removed some other way.
